 C/SP:,NAME,
C===========================================================
C C/SP - emit -ACC spaces when ACC is a negative plain integer;
C return immediately when it is zero or positive.  This is P/SP
C using P2C's plain-integer arithmetic mode instead of tagged values.
C===========================================================
 C/PF:,SUBP,
 SPACE*:,LC,1
 LOOP:13,UZA,                  . Nonnegative: return through M13
 ,ITS,13                       . Preserve the negative count
 ,UTC,SPACE*
 ,XTS,                         . Preserve M13; ACC := one space
 12,WTC,
 ,ATX,                         . Store it through the output FCB
 13,VJM,C/PF                   . Advance/flush the file buffer
 15,XTA,                       . Pop saved M13
 ,STI,13                       . Restore M13; pop saved count
 ,NTR,7                        . C/PF need not preserve arithmetic mode
 1,A+X,8                       . Plain count := count + 1
 ,UJ,LOOP
 ,END,
